  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2251,
      "text": "Kāf Ha Ya ‘Ayyn Sād[1]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2252,
      "text": "This is a reminder of the mercy of your Lord to His slave Zachariah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2253,
      "text": "When he called upon his Lord in private.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2254,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, my bones have grown feeble, and gray hair has spread across my head,[2] yet never have I been disappointed in my prayer to You, my Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2255,
      "text": "And I fear my kinsmen after me,[3] and my wife is barren; so grant me from Yourself an heir,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2256,
      "text": "who will inherit [prophethood] from me and from the house of Jacob, and make him, O Lord, well pleasing to You.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2257,
      "text": "[Allah said], “O Zachariah, We give you the glad tidings of a son, whose name will be John – a name that We have not given to anyone before.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2258,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, how can I have a son when my wife is barren, and I have reached an extremely old age?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2259,
      "text": "[The angel] said, “Thus it will be; your Lord says, ‘It is easy for Me; I did create you before when you were nothing.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2260,
      "text": "Zachariah said, “My Lord, give me a sign.” He said, “Your sign is that you will not be able to speak to people for three nights,[4] despite being sound.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 305,
      "ruku": 264,
      "hizbQuarter": 122,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2261,
      "text": "Thereupon he came out to his people from the sanctuary and signaled to them to glorify Allah morning and evening.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
